## Verdict

Asked to price a scale, the block found a space: a thousand admissible
windows in a small box, four escape classes beyond them, and no axiom
sentence that picks one — but also the two things the axioms DO say.
The records must lie inside their window (derived, from additivity,
with the permanence-selection reading of 885 corrected in the same
stroke), and the readout cannot see anything more (the extent is
gauge). What looked like a derivation gap is now a named pair of
supplied conventions and a theorem that explains why nothing in the
framework ever depended on the choice. Independent audit still
required.
